flowchart TD
    Client[Client Request] --> NginxProxy[Nginx Reverse Proxy / Load Balancer]
    NginxProxy --> CORSMiddleware[FastAPI CORSMiddleware]
    CORSMiddleware --> ExceptionHandler[Global Error Handling Middleware]
    ExceptionHandler --> RouterMatch{Match Route Endpoint}
    
    RouterMatch -->|/api/datasets| DatasetsRouter[src/api/routers/datasets.py]
    RouterMatch -->|/api/conversations| ConversationsRouter[src/api/routers/conversations.py]
    RouterMatch -->|/api/chat| ChatRouter[src/api/routers/chat.py]
    RouterMatch -->|/api/artifacts| ArtifactsRouter[src/api/routers/artifacts.py]
    RouterMatch -->|/api/semantic-categories| CategoriesRouter[src/api/routers/semantic_categories.py]

    DatasetsRouter --> Validation[Pydantic Schema Validation]
    ConversationsRouter --> Validation
    ChatRouter --> Validation

    Validation --> ServiceCall[Service Method Execution]
    ServiceCall --> AsyncSession[SQLAlchemy AsyncSession]
    AsyncSession --> Database[(PostgreSQL)]
    
    ChatRouter --> SSEResponse[StreamingResponse text/event-stream]
    SSEResponse --> Client
